+# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
+# Autograd Function 7: Ultra-Lean Combined Cam ShortConv4 + Prep + Bidi Scan + Apply O (v2)
+#   - Takes packed qkv_cam(B,N,3*C) directly: zero chunk/contiguous/cat copies!
